<title>FINLAND: Silja 9-mth loss narrows sharply.</title>
<headline>Silja 9-mth loss narrows sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss after financial items			32 vs 250 loss</p>
<p> Loss per share (markka)			 2.41 vs 16.62 loss</p>
<p> Net sales					  2,859 vs 2,690</p>
<p> Operating profit				   162 vs 15 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish passenger ferry operator is Silja Oy Ab.  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 361 vs 180</p>
<p> Depreciation					 199 vs 195</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 194 vs 235 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					   charge 1 vs 25 gain</p>
<p> Net loss						33 vs 225 loss</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    10.5 vs 11.7</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0245</p>
</text>
